
### 1. Create Memory
POST http://localhost:8080/api/memories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memoryType": "EXPERIENCE",
  "title": "First JavadAI Memory",
  "content": "JavadAI successfully connected to PostgreSQL and Flyway.",
  "source": "manual-test",
  "importance": 5
}

### 2. Get Recent Memories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memories?limit=20

### 3. Search Memories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memories/search?keyword=PostgreSQL&page=0&size=10

### 4. Get Memory By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memories/REPLACE_WITH_MEMORY_UUID

### 5. Get Memories By Type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/memories/type/EXPERIENCE?page=0&size=10

### 6. Soft Delete Memory
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/memories/REPLACE_WITH_MEMORY_UUID
